### F. §13 pre-upload audit (required)

On a **clean install** of the **release AAB** (install via `bundletool` or Internal testing track):

| Time | Check |
|------|--------|
| 0:00 | Cold launch, airplane mode — no crash |
| 0:30 | First screen matches screenshot #1 |
| 0:45 | Every home/HUD button cited in listing works |
| 1:00 | One non-obvious listed feature (leaderboard, daily tab, undo) |
| 1:20 | UI matches uploaded screenshots (theme, layout) |
| 2:00 | `adb logcat` — no repeating fatal JS errors |

Fill listing matrix in `docs/play-listings/<slug>.md` (or equivalent). **Do not** claim themes, modes, or leaderboard without discoverable UI (§13).

Re-capture **Play screenshots from release build on emulator** (1080×2400) — preview-server shots are draft only.

### G. Play Console upload (per app)

1. **Create app** → default language → app name matches standalone identity (not portal brand).
2. **Dashboard → Production** (or start with **Internal testing**).
3. **Create new release** → upload `app-release.aab`.
4. Complete required sections (first app takes longest):

| Section | TanStack WebView typical answers |
|---------|----------------------------------|
| **App category** | Game → Puzzle / Casual / etc. |
| **Store listing** | Short + full description from §13 matrix; 512×512 **PNG** icon; feature graphic 1024×500; ≥2 phone screenshots |
| **Content rating** | IARC questionnaire (usually low violence for puzzles) |
| **Target audience** | Age bands per content |
| **Data safety** | No data collected / all on-device if no `INTERNET` and no analytics |
| **Ads** | No (unless added) |
| **Privacy policy** | URL required if any data collected; offline-only games often still need a simple policy page |
| **App access** | All functionality available without login |

5. **Review and roll out** Internal testing first → fix Misleading Claims issues → promote to Production.
6. Update **all active tracks and locales** — stale hi-IN / testing tracks cause rejections (§13).

### H. Post-launch

- Keep `applicationId` stable forever.
- Each update: web build → `versionCode++` → new AAB → release notes cite visible UI changes.
- Do not publish a second app in the same category with duplicate positioning (e.g. Lumen Circuit + Circuit Flow).

