Here's the full spec for reproducing every asset type (promo video, icon, feature graphic, screenshots) for any game.

1. Promo Video (Remotion, 1080×1920, 17.5s)

Per-game composition data (`promos.data.ts`)

```ts
{
  id: "promo-<slug>",
  title: "<GAME NAME>",            // ALL CAPS display title
  tagline: "<verb>. <verb>. <payoff>.",  // 3-word rhythm
  clip: "clips/clip-<slug>.mp4",   // 2-5s real gameplay MP4
  clipCaption: "<MECHANIC · PAYOFF>",    // e.g. "TAP · NEIGHBORS +1"
  clipFrames: 60,                  // 60=2s, 90=3s, 150=5s
  primary: "#<hex>",               // brand hero color
  accent:  "#<hex>",               // secondary accent
  bgFrom:  "#0c0a09",              // dark gradient start
  bgTo:    "#<dark-hex>",          // dark gradient end (tinted toward primary)
  shots: [
