    { src: "shots/<slug>-2.png", caption: "<CORE RULE>",       badge: "RULE" },
    { src: "shots/<slug>-3.png", caption: "<WIN/COMBO>",       badge: "WIN"  },
    { src: "shots/<slug>-4.png", caption: "<REPLAY/OFFLINE>",  badge: "ANYTIME" },
  ],
  outro: "<GAME NAME>",
}
```

Timeline (525 frames @ 30fps)
| Beat | Frames | Time | Content |
|---|---|---|---|
| Hook title | 0–45 | 1.5s | Tagline + game title, spring in |
| Live clip | 45–105 | 2.0s | Real gameplay MP4 in device frame |
| Beat 1 | 105–195 | 3.0s | Screenshot + HOOK caption, Ken Burns |
| Beat 2 | 195–285 | 3.0s | Screenshot + RULE caption |
| Beat 3 | 285–375 | 3.0s | Screenshot + WIN caption |
| Beat 4 | 375–465 | 3.0s | Screenshot + ANYTIME caption |
| Outro | 465–525 | 2.0s | Big title + "Play free on Android" |

Visual system (constants across all promos)
- Fonts: Sora (display/badges/title), Inter (body/captions)
- Entrance motion: `spring({ damping: 18–22, stiffness: 130–140 })`
- Ken Burns: `interpolate(frame, [0, 90], [1.04, 1.14])` on screenshots
- Device frame: 720×1280 rounded shell, 56px radius, 3px `primary` border, colored drop-shadow `0 40px 80px ${primary}55`
- Background: Radial gradients drifting via `Math.sin(frame/60)` for parallax
- Caption pill: bottom-center, `linear-gradient(90deg, primary, accent)`, 999px radius, Sora 700 uppercase
- Badge (top-right): small dark pill with `primary` text, Sora 600
- Outro CTA: `Play free on Android` — Inter 500, 60% opacity

